### =========================================================================
### Car Sharing API - Task #6: Method Security Annotations (@PreAuthorize)
### 10 HTTP Requests for Annotated Routes via Different Users
###   1. user       / user123       (Role: USER)
###   2. admin      / admin123      (Role: ADMIN)
###   3. superadmin / superadmin123 (Role: SUPERADMIN)
### =========================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

###1. [USER] GET all vehicles (@PreAuthorize("hasAnyRole('USER', 'ADMIN', 'SUPERADMIN')"))
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/vehicles
Authorization: Basic user user123
Accept: application/json

###

###2. [USER] GET fleet by ID (@PreAuthorize("hasAnyRole('USER', 'ADMIN', 'SUPERADMIN')"))
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/fleets/1
Authorization: Basic user user123
Accept: application/json

###

###3. [USER] POST rent vehicle (@PreAuthorize("hasAnyRole('USER', 'ADMIN', 'SUPERADMIN')"))
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/vehicles/1/rent?userId=1
Authorization: Basic user user123
Accept: application/json

###

###4. [ADMIN] GET all users (@PreAuthorize("hasAnyRole('ADMIN', 'SUPERADMIN')"))
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users
Authorization: Basic admin admin123
Accept: application/json

###

###5. [ADMIN] POST create fleet (@PreAuthorize("hasAnyRole('ADMIN', 'SUPERADMIN')"))
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/fleets
Authorization: Basic admin admin123
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "id": "2",
  "name": "North Station Fleet",
  "address": "Heroiv Maydanu St. 15",
  "capacity": 30
}

###

###6. [ADMIN] PUT update fleet (@PreAuthorize("hasAnyRole('ADMIN', 'SUPERADMIN')"))
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/fleets/2
Authorization: Basic admin admin123
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "id": "2",
  "name": "North Station Fleet Updated",
  "address": "Heroiv Maydanu St. 15A",
  "capacity": 40
}

###

###7. [ADMIN] POST create vehicle (@PreAuthorize("hasAnyRole('ADMIN', 'SUPERADMIN')"))
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/vehicles
Authorization: Basic admin admin123
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "id": "3",
  "brand": "Hyundai",
  "model": "Ioniq 5",
  "registrationNumber": "CE7788EE",
  "fleetId": "2",
  "rentedByUserId": null
}

###

###8. [SUPERADMIN] POST create user (@PreAuthorize("hasRole('SUPERADMIN')"))
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users
Authorization: Basic superadmin superadmin123
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "id": "2",
  "email": "taras.koval@example.com",
  "fullName": "Taras Koval",
  "driverLicense": "CE998877"
}

###

###9. [SUPERADMIN] PUT update user (@PreAuthorize("hasRole('SUPERADMIN')"))
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/2
Authorization: Basic superadmin superadmin123
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "id": "2",
  "email": "taras.koval.updated@example.com",
  "fullName": "Taras Koval Updated",
  "driverLicense": "CE998877-UPD"
}

###

###10. [SUPERADMIN] DELETE vehicle (@PreAuthorize("hasRole('SUPERADMIN')"))
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/vehicles/3
Authorization: Basic superadmin superadmin123
Accept: application/json

###

### =========================================================================
### Negative Checks on Annotated Routes (403 Forbidden)
### =========================================================================

###11. [USER -> 403 Forbidden] USER cannot access @PreAuthorize("hasAnyRole('ADMIN', 'SUPERADMIN')")
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users
Authorization: Basic user user123
Accept: application/json

###

###12. [ADMIN -> 403 Forbidden] ADMIN cannot access @PreAuthorize("hasRole('SUPERADMIN')")
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/fleets/2
Authorization: Basic admin admin123
Accept: application/json
